I didn't realize that my vow was missing.
Upon resigning from the mandate he knew that in the next few months it was mainly Bolshevism of the Chamber of Deputies and the destruction of everything positive, Topolánek himself reacted.
Depending on the new train schedule, fewer trains will circulate at almost the same fares
From 13 December they will cancel or restrict some less-used rapid and local trains and, on the contrary, reinforce some links.
