National police officers arrested the man without identity documents.
The Nanterre Prosecutor &apos; &apos; s Office submitted the investigation into the jurisdiction of the Departmental Service of the Upper Seine Judicial Police (SDPJ 92).
Footage was hospitalized on Thursday evening.
During his pre-trial detention he did not say a word.
A police source doesn't rule out the possibility of being placed in a psychiatric hospital.
